OL,3,GNEWSAMum launches 'garage anxiety'
OL,4,Acourses after son faced #2,000 car bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Sharon Hilton's son was told the
OL,7,Fcar he owned needed more than #2,500
OL,8,Fworth of repairs, she knew he was being
OL,9,Fripped off.
OL,11,FThe then 18-year-old had bought it from
OL,12,Fa dealership just three months prior,
OL,13,Fand wanted to take the car for a
OL,14,Fservice and MOT to show his parents he
OL,15,Fcould be responsible for maintaining
OL,16,Fhis car.
OL,18,FHilton, who works for Warwickshire Road
OL,19,FSafety Partnership, said her son was
OL,20,F'distraught' at the thought of having
OL,21,Fto a pay a huge bill for repairs.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
