OL,3,GNEWSAMum launches 'garage anxiety'
OL,4,Acourses after son faced #2,000 car bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "We had the car inspected
OL,7,Felsewhere and there were no defects on
OL,8,Fthe car and the vehicle hadn't failed
OL,9,Fits MOT. But once I got involved they
OL,10,Fbacktracked and said they were just
OL,11,Fadvisories."
